= About me

I am a PhD student at #link("https://www.ovgu.de/")[Otto von Guericke University Magdeburg] under the supervision of #link("https://thomas-kahle.de/")[Thomas Kahle]. My research interests lie in commutative algebra, computational algebra, and combinatorics, with a particular focus on monomial ideals, binomial ideals, free resolutions, and the computer algebra system #link("https://macaulay2.com/")[Macaulay2].

Besides mathematics, I enjoy music (especially classical music) and I play the piano and the alto saxophone. I also like hiking, running, and skiing, and I enjoy reading books and going to the cinema.

